data: {"id":"gen-1791333651-sB9hSK4xAKVrXtDTAHq5","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1791333651,"model":"inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-vl","provider":"Novita","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   Input: A screenshot of a web page (Kanban board style).\n    *   Task: Describe the screenshot for a web-automation agent.\n    *   Format constraints:\n        1) Page purpose: one line.\n        2) Visible text: EXACT strings on buttons, links, headings, tabs, menu items. Quote verbatim.\n        3) Inputs: list form fields (label, placeholder, current value, focus/disabled).\n        4) State signals: spinners, toasts, modals, errors, success, CAPTCHAs, consent banners, overlays.\n        5) Blockers: anything preventing next action.\n        6) Unknowns: anything unreadable.\n    *   Rules: No prose intro, no conclusion, no \"this screenshot shows...\", no layout description unless relevant. Blank/loading -> say so and stop.\n\n2.  **Analyze the Image:**\n    *   *Top Nav:* \"WebScene\" (logo), \"Home\", \"Workspace\", \"Activity\". Right side: a green circle icon (user avatar/profile).\n    *   *Main Content:* A large white card/container.\n    *   *Heading:* \"Sprint 18\".\n    *   *Top Right of Card:* A pill button \"Board\".\n    *   *Columns (Kanban):*\n        *   Column 1: \"Backlog\" (count: 1). Card inside: \"TASK\", \"Add filters\", \"...\" (more options).\n        *   Column 2: \"In progress\" (count: 1). Card inside: \"TASK\", \"Fix checkout\", \"...\" (more options).\n        *   Column 3: \"Done\" (count: 1). Card inside: \"TASK\", \"Update docs\", \"...\" (more options).\n    *   *State signals:* None visible (no spinners, toasts, modals, etc.).\n    *   *Inputs:* No form fields visible.\n    *   *Blockers:* None obvious.\n\n3.  **Draft the Content according to format:**\n\n    *   1) Page purpose: Project management / Kanban board for Sprint 18.\n    *   2) Visible text:\n        *   WebScene\n        *   H